<title>ITALY: Marzotto reports higher 1996 net profit.</title>
<headline>Marzotto reports higher 1996 net profit.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year months ending Dec 31, 1997</p>
<p>(In billion lire unless stated)</p>
<p>    Cons net profit			58.1   vs 50.1</p>
<p>    Cons operating profit		200.4  vs 207.8</p>
<p>    Cons turnover			 2,225.4 vs 2,356.8</p>
<p>    Parent co turnover		  1,056.7 vs down 7.9 per cent</p>
<p>    Parent co operating profit	   73.6 vs 79.6</p>
<p>    Parent co  net profit		33.1   vs 28.7</p>
<p>    Investments			    111.4  vs 117.5</p>
<p>    Net financial position	     549.4  vs 458.1</p>
<p>Note - Marzotto said net finnancial charges were 35.6 billion lire, which was 1.6 percent of consolidated turnover, down from 1.9 percent in 1995. -- Milan newsroom +392 66129450</p>
</text>
